  "body": "## Fixed\n\n- Restore case-insensitive fuzzy table/object search: `uspo` finds `user_posts` again. (#364, #365)\n- Preserve relevance ranking, qualified search scoping, exact-name narrowing, unique result counts, and tree-order navigation.\n\nNo configuration changes are required.\n\n**Full changelog:** https://github.com/jorgerojas26/lazysql/compare/v0.6.0...v0.7.0\n"
